metrics.anchor:
variety of domains. nDCG@10 is reported as the main metric by following (Thakur et al., 2021;
Xiao et al., 2024), accessing both recall and ranking abilities. Recalls (R@{20, 50, 100}) are also
reported to assess retrieval ability at large windows.
